quency_escapequeen_01_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"quency_e","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_quency_escapequeen_01_20","text":"I've got a business deal scheduled for tomorrow,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_quency_escapequeen_01_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"quency_e","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_quency_escapequeen_01_21","text":"so I need to get this done tonight.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_quency_escapequeen_01_22","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_quency_escapequeen_01_22","text":"What's in it for me?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_quency_escapequeen_01_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"quency_e","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_quency_escapequeen_01_23","text":"Hmm...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_quency_escapequeen_01_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"quency_e","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_quency_escapequeen_01_24","text":"I can't give you any credit,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_quency_escapequeen_01_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"quency_e","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_quency_escapequeen_01_25","text":"but I could grant you three wishes.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_quency_escapequeen_01_26","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_quency_escapequeen_01_26","text":"Three?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_quency_escapequeen_01_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"quency_e","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_quency_escapequeen_01_27","text":"Is that enough?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_quency_escapequeen_01_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"quency_e","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_quency_escapequeen_01_28","text":"You can wish for anything you'd like.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_quency_escapequeen_01_29","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_quency_escapequeen_01_29","text":"Anything? Okay, I'm in.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_quency_escapequeen_01_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"quency_e","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_quency_escapequeen_01_30","text":"??","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_quency_escapequeen_01_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"quency_e","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_quency_escapequeen_01_31","text":"What kind of things do you intend on wishing for?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_quency_escapequeen_01_32","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_quency_escapequeen_01_32","text":"I'm not telling.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_quency_escapequeen_01_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"quency_e","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_quency_escapequeen_01_33","text":"Come on, what is it?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_quency_escapequeen_01_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"quency_e","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_quency_escapequeen_01_34","text":"Tell meeeeee!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_quency_escapequeen_01_35","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_quency_escapequeen_01_35","text":"I'll tell you once we're done with the tunnel.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_quency_escapequeen_01_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"quency_e","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_quency_escapequeen_01_36","text":"Aw c'mon, I wanna know!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_quency_escapequeen_01_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"quency_e","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_quency_escapequeen_01_37","text":"Fine. I'll come over to the Commander's Room in the evening.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_quency_escapequeen_01_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"quency_e","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_quency_escapequeen_01_38","text":"See you then.","jump":null}],"chat":true}